    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what are you talking about? You're acting so strange... like you've forgotten everything. We're still here, in the ruins. The fires are burning just beyond the gates and the grain is all gone. I'm not talking about the world outside these walls, I'm talking about *this*. About us. How can you be so cold when we're just waiting for the end?",
